  "ja79:1.1": "yato viluttā ca hatā ca gāvo ",
  "ja79:1.2": "daḍḍhāni gehāni jano ca nīto, ",
  "ja79:1.3": "athāgamā puttahatāya putto ",
  "ja79:1.4": "kharassaraṃ deṇḍimaṃ vādayantoti. ",
  "ja79:2.1": "kharassarajātakaṃ. "
